    "name": "Rogue Climber",
    "steam_appid": 2673440,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>The clock is ticking. Reality is crumbling. You\u2019re being hunted down. Can you survive the climb?</i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nah.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tick-tock. Enemies are closing in. The further you climb, the more challenging it becomes. Every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/398c9478b61ccb68c61b25949a7df4fb.poster.avif?t=1751035883\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/398c9478b61ccb68c61b25949a7df4fb.webm?t=1751035883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/398c9478b61ccb68c61b25949a7df4fb.mp4?t=1751035883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Movement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blink-dash through the chaos, ground-pound into your foes, and chain wall-runs like a parkour master\u2014master the climb, or plummet to your doom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies &amp; Traps Around Every Corner</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spikes bursting from the floor, fire-breathing monsters, and gravity itself are all out to stop you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/1e8713636f0d61b28916140689c75833.poster.avif?t=1751035883\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/1e8713636f0d61b28916140689c75833.webm?t=1751035883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/1e8713636f0d61b28916140689c75833.mp4?t=1751035883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Gear</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect one-time-use equipment as you climb\u2014but beware, carrying too much will weigh you down. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your loadout with powerful upgrades, but choose wisely\u2014your slots are limited. Level them dynamically as you climb, adapting to every challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/894d0e83abc95262e352ac105eaba8ca.poster.avif?t=1751035883\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/894d0e83abc95262e352ac105eaba8ca.webm?t=1751035883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/894d0e83abc95262e352ac105eaba8ca.mp4?t=1751035883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Challenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The climb never gets easier, only you get better. No excuses. No mercy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>You still think you've got what it takes?</i> <strong>We'll see about that.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/ba5aae66ed8294a37734ce6a86e0fdaa.poster.avif?t=1751035883\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/ba5aae66ed8294a37734ce6a86e0fdaa.webm?t=1751035883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gobbos might seem harmless\u2014but don\u2019t let your guard down. When lightning rods black out your vision and <strong>a swarm of man-eating cave worms surround you on all sides</strong>, landing your jumps on a Gobbo's cap will make your palms sweat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find checkpoints along the way. They're one-time-use only, though. And yes, there\u2019s a grapplehook. Because <strong>grapplehooks make everything better.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/a5c62638f57f634a3d3b141a37cdb07b.poster.avif?t=1751035883\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/a5c62638f57f634a3d3b141a37cdb07b.webm?t=1751035883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip Seals to unlock powerful abilities\u2014but there\u2019s a catch. <strong>Each level has a PWR limit</strong>, so choosing the right Seals is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crystals let you boost Seal power during your climb, but <strong>upgrades happen at random</strong>. Will you gamble on a full loadout or focus on a few to guarantee the boost? The choice is yours\u2014use your noggin or trust your luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/5b46416de111a13f1fa09292910a0c6e.poster.avif?t=1751035883\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/5b46416de111a13f1fa09292910a0c6e.webm?t=1751035883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still here? Good\u2014you\u2019re tough enough for the <strong>advanced movement controls</strong>. Wall-runs, blink-dashes, ground-pounds, and jump-combos are just the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The deeper you explore the controls, the more you\u2019ll uncover.</strong> Use blink-dashes to phase through obstacles, sprint to extend combos, or queue a dash for later with precision timing. Master the climb, and the climb will reward you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Only the fastest, sharpest, and most precise climbers will rise above the rest. Will you be counted among their number?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>The clock is ticking. Reality is crumbling. You\u2019re being hunted down. Can you survive the climb?</i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nah.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tick-tock. Enemies are closing in. The further you climb, the more challenging it becomes. Every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/398c9478b61ccb68c61b25949a7df4fb.poster.avif?t=1751035883\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/398c9478b61ccb68c61b25949a7df4fb.webm?t=1751035883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/398c9478b61ccb68c61b25949a7df4fb.mp4?t=1751035883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Movement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blink-dash through the chaos, ground-pound into your foes, and chain wall-runs like a parkour master\u2014master the climb, or plummet to your doom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies &amp; Traps Around Every Corner</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spikes bursting from the floor, fire-breathing monsters, and gravity itself are all out to stop you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/1e8713636f0d61b28916140689c75833.poster.avif?t=1751035883\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/1e8713636f0d61b28916140689c75833.webm?t=1751035883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/1e8713636f0d61b28916140689c75833.mp4?t=1751035883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Gear</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect one-time-use equipment as you climb\u2014but beware, carrying too much will weigh you down. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your loadout with powerful upgrades, but choose wisely\u2014your slots are limited. Level them dynamically as you climb, adapting to every challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/894d0e83abc95262e352ac105eaba8ca.poster.avif?t=1751035883\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/894d0e83abc95262e352ac105eaba8ca.webm?t=1751035883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/894d0e83abc95262e352ac105eaba8ca.mp4?t=1751035883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Challenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The climb never gets easier, only you get better. No excuses. No mercy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>You still think you've got what it takes?</i> <strong>We'll see about that.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/ba5aae66ed8294a37734ce6a86e0fdaa.poster.avif?t=1751035883\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/ba5aae66ed8294a37734ce6a86e0fdaa.webm?t=1751035883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gobbos might seem harmless\u2014but don\u2019t let your guard down. When lightning rods black out your vision and <strong>a swarm of man-eating cave worms surround you on all sides</strong>, landing your jumps on a Gobbo's cap will make your palms sweat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find checkpoints along the way. They're one-time-use only, though. And yes, there\u2019s a grapplehook. Because <strong>grapplehooks make everything better.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/a5c62638f57f634a3d3b141a37cdb07b.poster.avif?t=1751035883\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/a5c62638f57f634a3d3b141a37cdb07b.webm?t=1751035883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip Seals to unlock powerful abilities\u2014but there\u2019s a catch. <strong>Each level has a PWR limit</strong>, so choosing the right Seals is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crystals let you boost Seal power during your climb, but <strong>upgrades happen at random</strong>. Will you gamble on a full loadout or focus on a few to guarantee the boost? The choice is yours\u2014use your noggin or trust your luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/5b46416de111a13f1fa09292910a0c6e.poster.avif?t=1751035883\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673440/extras/5b46416de111a13f1fa09292910a0c6e.webm?t=1751035883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still here? Good\u2014you\u2019re tough enough for the <strong>advanced movement controls</strong>. Wall-runs, blink-dashes, ground-pounds, and jump-combos are just the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The deeper you explore the controls, the more you\u2019ll uncover.</strong> Use blink-dashes to phase through obstacles, sprint to extend combos, or queue a dash for later with precision timing. Master the climb, and the climb will reward you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Only the fastest, sharpest, and most precise climbers will rise above the rest. Will you be counted among their number?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "You've only got a short time to climb. An army of enemies and traps are waiting to stop you. Manage your equipment, hone your build, and master your platforming techniques to climb higher than anyone before you.You think you've got what it takes? I don't think so.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Armenian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cRogue Climber was born from a late-night experiment, a first-person platformer built on fluid parkour, unpredictable obstacles and a constant tension between frustration and triumph, climb after climb.\u201d<br>Gamezilla<br><br>\u201cRogue Climber turns every ascent into a tense, high-stakes challenge, combining precise parkour, roguelike surprises and fast-paced vertical action.\u201d<br>Onigamers<br><br>\u201cRogue Climber delivers intense, strategic first\u2011person parkour. Each procedurally generated run is a fresh test of reflexes, gear choice and daring ascents.\u201d<br>Jam Games<br>",
